\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7.1}{\ignorespaces ND280 Monitor during an extended long-duration acquisition test of the Reference Single-Sensor Node. At the time of the screenshot, Node~4 running NodeOS v0.5.3-alpha1 reported an uptime of 273792~s, 197589 successful measurements, no measurement failures, no TWI errors, no UART receive overflow and no EEPROM errors. The monitor simultaneously displays magnetic-field and temperature trends, node status, the diagnostic response and the raw NodeOS serial stream.}}{29}{figure.caption.19}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:monitor_long_run}{{7.1}{29}{ND280 Monitor during an extended long-duration acquisition test of the Reference Single-Sensor Node. At the time of the screenshot, Node~4 running NodeOS v0.5.3-alpha1 reported an uptime of 273792~s, 197589 successful measurements, no measurement failures, no TWI errors, no UART receive overflow and no EEPROM errors. The monitor simultaneously displays magnetic-field and temperature trends, node status, the diagnostic response and the raw NodeOS serial stream}{figure.caption.19}{}}
